OL,3,GNEWSAPlans unveiled for swim and sauna
OL,4,Acomplex
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew details have been announced of a
OL,7,Fswim and sauna complex that could
OL,8,Ftransform an old dock in Cardiff.
OL,10,FWaterfront developers Nordic Urban
OL,11,Frevealed plans to transform the old
OL,12,Fgrade-II Mount Stuart Graving Docks in
OL,13,FCardiff Bay into a 12,400 square metre
OL,14,Fyear-round outdoor swimming and sauna
OL,15,Fcomplex.
OL,17,FIt will include a 25 metre outdoor
OL,18,Fheated swimming pool, along with hot
OL,19,Fand cold pools, four saunas, changing
OL,20,Fand relaxation rooms as well as a cafe,
OL,21,Frestaurant, terraces overlooking the
OL,22,Fwater and a rain garden.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
